# This image is fully assembled from vendor artifacts and never needs source
# files from the build context except the session and Codex wrappers. Keeping the context
# limited to these explicit inputs avoids
# accidentally sending repository history, agent state, or credentials to the
# Docker daemon (including a remote builder).
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!images/
!images/codegenbox-session
!images/codegenbox-codex
!images/codex
